#. i18n: file editshortcutbase.ui line 26
#: rc.cpp:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A single shortcut can be easily assigned or cleared using the two buttons. Only shortcuts with modifiers can be used.<p>\n"
"It is possible to have several possible shortcuts, and the first available shortcut will be used. The shortcuts are specified using space-separated shortcut sets. One set is specified as <i>base</i>+(<i>list</i>), where base are modifiers and list is a list of keys.<br>\n"
"For example \"<b>Shift+Alt+(123) Shift+Ctrl+(ABC)</b>\" will first try <b>Shift+Alt+1</b>, then others with <b>Shift+Ctrl+C</b> as the last one."
msgstr ""
"Berär çaptırmanı bu ike töymä aşa bilgeläp/beterep bula. Üzgärteç töymä belän genä çaptırmalar yasap bula.<p>\n"
"Çaptırmanı berniçä dä yasap bula, buş bulğannarnıñ berençese qullanılaçaq ul çaqta. Bu çaptırmalar bonda buşlıq belän ayırılıp kürsätelä. Tözeleşe bondí: <i>üzgärtkeç</i>+(<i>tezmä</i>).<br>\n"
"Ürnäk öçen \"<b>Shift+Alt+(123) Shift+Ctrl+(ABC)</b>\" kertelsä, berençe bulıp <b>Shift+Alt+1</b> sınalır, annarı başqalar, soñğı bulıp <b>Shift+Ctrl+C</b> qullanılır."

